pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |-
  训练设置：归一化、7:3/8:2/9:1 划分、序列长度 20、批 256、节点 128、Adam。
  表 7（9:1）显示含 Q 的 LSTM 误差最低；三点发现：数据越多误差越小、含 Q 更优、LSTM 最好。
elements:
  - elementId: chapter-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 960, 56]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: chapter-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 18, 760, 20]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: '03. 预测模型 —— 训练设置与算法对比'
  - elementId: chapter-brand
    elementType: text
    bounds: [736, 20, 176, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.8
      color: "$accent6"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: EV RANGE · 学术报告
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 70, 864, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 9:1 划分、含 Q 输入、LSTM：三项设置同时最优
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 104, 864, 16]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 9.6
      wrap: false
      text: 四车输入归一化；序列长度 20、批 256、节点 128、迭代 100、Adam 优化器
  - elementId: setup-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 132, 264, 332]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
    shadow: { blur: 10, color: "#1F5FBF14", offset: [0, 2] }
  - elementId: setup-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 146, 232, 14]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      fontSize: 8.4
      wrap: false
      text: 训练设置
  - elementId: setup-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 164, 232, 66]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 8.9
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: 训练 / 测试按 7:3、8:2、9:1 三种比例划分（不随机抽样）；序列长度 20、批 256、节点 128、迭代 100 次。
  - elementId: setup-divider-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 238, 232, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: cmp-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 248, 232, 14]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      fontSize: 8.4
      wrap: false
      text: 对比方案与指标
  - elementId: cmp-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 266, 232, 60]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 8.9
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: 对比 SVR、BP、RNN 与 LSTM 四种算法，输入含 / 不含 Q；以 RMSE 与 MAE 评价预测效果。
  - elementId: setup-divider-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 334, 232, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$line" }
  - elementId: find-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 344, 232, 14]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      fontSize: 8.4
      wrap: false
      text: 三点发现
  - elementId: find-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 362, 232, 92]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 8.9
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |-
        <p><strong>①</strong> 训练集比例增大，RMSE / MAE 整体降低，9:1 最优；</p>
        <p style="margin-top:3px"><strong>②</strong> 含 Q 的模型误差总体小于不含 Q；</p>
        <p style="margin-top:3px"><strong>③</strong> LSTM 在四种算法中预测效果最好。</p>
  - elementId: table-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [328, 132, 584, 258]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
